{"id": "scattered-site-housing-rebid", "title": "The city canceled a housing competition after its planned start date", "seconds": 67.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "a47bb41cec07236c", "words": 160, "beats": [{"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco invited providers to compete for 2,821 existing housing slots.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.41, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2,821", "label": "Existing subsidy and voucher-support slots"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.93, 1.36, 1.86, 1.96, 2.36, 2.53, 2.83, 3.34, 3.6, 4.04, 4.72, 5.34, 5.72]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The city expected the first agreements to start in May 2026.", "t0": 6.53, "t1": 10.84, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rfq", "kicker": "RFQ 155", "text": "Rolling agreement starts", "mark": "May 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.5, 1.05, 1.17, 1.52, 2.02, 2.16, 2.49, 2.64, 3.09, 3.46]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Providers challenged a rule that used submission time to break ties.", "t0": 10.96, "t1": 15.14, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "qa", "kicker": "Question 38", "text": "Selection rule", "mark": "submission time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.62, 1.1, 1.2, 1.55, 1.75, 2.08, 2.61, 3.13, 3.31, 3.62]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The city changed the rule and extended the deadline to November 4.", "t0": 15.26, "t1": 19.52, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "add", "kicker": "Addendum 1", "text": "New proposal deadline", "mark": "November 4"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.62, 1.15, 1.31, 1.82, 2.07, 2.63, 2.74, 3.21, 3.35, 3.79]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Approved startup costs could cover hiring, training and moving participants between programs.", "t0": 19.64, "t1": 25.82, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rfq", "kicker": "Startup period", "text": "Hire and train staff", "mark": "page 8"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 1.01, 1.52, 1.73, 2.07, 2.93, 3.82, 4.06, 4.43, 5.07, 5.48]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "July brought a separate grant to Brilliant Corners to keep rental subsidies going.", "t0": 26.04, "t1": 31.0, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "grant", "kicker": "Executed agreement", "text": "Housing subsidies", "mark": "July 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.77, 0.87, 1.33, 1.75, 1.9, 2.33, 3.1, 3.27, 3.57, 3.94, 4.51]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Larkin Street won a separate youth housing competition under request 154.", "t0": 31.12, "t1": 37.08, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "youth", "kicker": "Youth housing", "text": "Castro Youth Housing Initiative", "mark": "RFP 154"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.82, 1.03, 1.14, 1.64, 1.91, 2.26, 3.21, 3.46, 4.53, 4.79, 5.18]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "On November 5, the department announced it was canceling the scattered-site competition.", "t0": 37.2, "t1": 42.14, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plan", "kicker": "Director’s report", "text": "Revised solicitation planned", "mark": "November 5"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.64, 1.35, 1.5, 1.98, 2.43, 2.54, 2.72, 3.26, 3.37, 4.17]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It cited federal funding changes and plans to measure results differently.", "t0": 42.26, "t1": 46.59, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plan", "kicker": "Agency explanation", "text": "Federal funding and program design", "mark": "page 23"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.68, 1.18, 1.63, 2.15, 2.3, 2.84, 2.99, 3.32, 3.77]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Analysts put the overall procurement timetable two years behind its original schedule.", "t0": 46.71, "t1": 51.62, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2 years", "label": "Expected completion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.79, 0.94, 1.39, 1.99, 2.67, 3.04, 3.48, 3.82, 3.97, 4.4]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The proposed subsidy bridge ran through December 2027.", "t0": 51.84, "t1": 55.79, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Brilliant Corners", "text": "Proposed extension", "mark": "December 2027"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 1.13, 1.51, 1.75, 2.02, 2.76, 3.16]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Yet the city expected new subsidy agreements by July 2029.", "t0": 55.91, "t1": 60.73, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Subsidy pool", "text": "Expected new agreements", "mark": "July 2029"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.46, 0.83, 1.48, 1.8, 2.33, 3.14, 3.37, 3.82, 4.13]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "It told analysts it might seek another extension.", "t0": 60.85, "t1": 63.66, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Budget analysis", "text": "Further extension", "mark": "page 31"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 1.06, 1.2, 1.47, 1.79, 2.12]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 63.78, "t1": 66.42, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"c": "The original competition", "a": "The canceled solicitation", "r": "The next contract"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}